        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 31</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Wutan eac ealle ymbe friþes bote ⁊ ymbe feos bote smeagean swyðe georne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Further, let us all earnestly take thought for the promotion of public security and the improvement of the coinage.</ab>
